      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "relaxed hand is the default gesture for wmr, vive, index and desktop. and even on oculus for that matter, touch controllers are made so that the relaxed hand position is default, and not open. because youre going to keep your finger on or near the grip while holding the controller normally. this does not make sense. Having a more sensible binding system for desktop would be a better suggestion here.",
