      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5bf14d69b146880205a1f304|full_name}: Maybe my habit of not touching the grip trigger button is wrong and everyone else will be used to putting their index finger on the trigger button?\nI also try to touch the trigger button, but I always feel that I will press it by mistake to trigger the wrong item",
