  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-11T03:54:32.914Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "F1 is the default gesture on PC = no expression\nF3 is open hand\nVR is open hand without holding any button\nTouching the trigger is the default gesture = no expression\nThis leads to many avatars in VR have been in other expressions\nThis is very unreasonable, I think it makes more sense to swap the position of F1 and F3 on the PC, and open hand is the default gesture.\nI know it would be difficult to completely break the design that vrchat has been using, but I think it's necessary for the sake of uniformity across platforms.",
